otentially spammy, indicating possible issues with search functionality or data integrity.\n\n### Recommendations\n- **Content Strategy**: Focus on improving content quality, especially for pages with low average time spent.\n- **SEO Enhancement**: Increase efforts in SEO to balance traffic sources and reduce reliance on direct traffic.\n- **User Engagement**: Investigate reasons for decreased session duration and implement strategies to enhance user engagement.\n- **Search Functionality**: Review and optimize search functionality to ensure relevant and meaningful search results.",
